    <bpmn:process id="W_W4822" name="W4822. Multi-Entity License Coverage, Affiliate &amp; Entity-Level Licensing Decisions" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New entity (5-entity group); a service moving to a different entity; intercompany scope (VS-72)
Frequency: On entity/structure change + annual
Volume: 5 entities; ~which-entity-does-the-work decisions
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance / PCAB Compliance Lead
Participants: Tax (VS-79 intercompany/transfer pricing), Treasury (VS-18), Trade Sales (VS-11), Shared Services (VS-72)
Source: workflow W4822 — Multi-Entity License Coverage, Affiliate &amp; Entity-Level Licensing Decisions</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4822_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4822_Lane1" name="PCAB Compliance Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4822_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4822_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4822_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4822_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4822_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4822_Start3" name="New entity (5-entity group); a service moving to a different entity; intercompany scope…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4822_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4822_Task4" name="Determine the license-holding entity per service line: e.g., Depot Inc. for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Determine the license-holding entity per service line: e.g., Depot Inc. for retail installation (VS-12) and B2G delivery-and-install (VS-46), Logistics Inc. if it performs scope, Property Mgmt Inc. for its own build (VS-20); assess branch coverage vs separate licenses; reconcile with the intercompany/chargeback model (VS-72) and transfer pricing (VS-79)
Responsible (R): PCAB Compliance Lead / Legal / Tax / Treasury
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4822_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4822_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4822_Task5" name="Manage affiliate/branch registration where a single license must enumerate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Manage affiliate/branch registration where a single license must enumerate branch/store locations doing in-scope work (200 stores) — register the branches authorized to perform installation under the entity license; update on store open (VS-37)/close (VS-59)/remodel (VS-109)
Responsible (R): PCAB Compliance Lead / Store Ops (VS-07) / Legal
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4822_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4822_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4822_Task6" name="Govern cross-entity contracting: when one licensed entity performs work for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Govern cross-entity contracting: when one licensed entity performs work for another BuildRight entity (intercompany), document the contractor-of-record, license applicability, and arm&#x27;s-length terms; feed to intercompany settlement (VS-72) and consolidated reporting (VS-17)
Responsible (R): PCAB Compliance Lead / Legal / Tax
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance / CFO
Duration: Per arrangement</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4822_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4822_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4822_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4822_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-168 (ensure PCAB licensing validity &amp; capacity limits.) | - CTL-725: license-holding entity decided per service line; branches enumerated; intercompany contracting arm&#x27;s-length + tax-reviewed
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance / PCAB Compliance Lead</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4822_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4822_Annotation8" targetRef="W4822_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
