    <bpmn:process id="W_W4823" name="W4823. PCAB License Compliance Recordkeeping, Evidence Repository &amp; Audit Trail" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: License activity (issue/renew/upgrade/project-register); audit; regulator request
Frequency: Continuous + on audit
Volume: All license &amp; project-registration records
Owner: PCAB Compliance Lead / Compliance Portfolio (VS-166) / Records (VS-88)
Participants: Legal (VS-100.3), Finance, Internal Audit (VS-21)
Source: workflow W4823 — PCAB License Compliance Recordkeeping, Evidence Repository &amp; Audit Trail</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4823_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4823_Lane1" name="PCAB Compliance Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4823_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4823_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4823_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4823_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4823_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4823_Start3" name="License activity (issue/renew/upgrade/project-register); audit; regulator request">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4823_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4823_Task4" name="Maintain the PCAB evidence repository per license: certificate of registration…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Maintain the PCAB evidence repository per license: certificate of registration, application packages, renewal filings, capitalization/FS evidence, technical-personnel roster, equipment list, insurance certificates (links to W4735), safety program (W4827), project-registration acknowledgments (W4825), and correspondence with CIAP/PCAB — retained per BIR/NIRC 10-year and records (VS-88) rules
Responsible (R): PCAB Compliance Lead / Records
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4823_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4823_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4823_Task5" name="Maintain the contractor-compliance audit trail: every in-scope contract…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Maintain the contractor-compliance audit trail: every in-scope contract (customer/vendor/owner, scope, value, category-applicability, license-used, project-registration), bond linkage (VS-116), and inspection/penalty history (W4833/W4838); reconcile to the legal contract repository (VS-100.3) and finance project accounting (VS-40/VS-11)
Responsible (R): PCAB Compliance Lead / Legal / Finance
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4823_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4823_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4823_Task6" name="On audit/regulator request (W4833/W4860), produce evidence packets; support…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: On audit/regulator request (W4833/W4860), produce evidence packets; support internal audit (VS-21) control testing of license conditions; feed the evidence completeness and gaps to analytics (W4839)
Responsible (R): PCAB Compliance Lead / Records / Internal Audit
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per audit</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4823_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4823_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4823_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4823_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-168 (ensure PCAB licensing validity &amp; capacity limits.) | - CTL-725: complete evidence repository per license; 10-year retention (VS-88); reconciled to contracts and project accounting
Owner: PCAB Compliance Lead / Compliance Portfolio (VS-166) / Records (VS-88)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
